OL,3,GNEWSAOil tank vandalism results in
OL,4,Awaterfowl park 'nightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecovery efforts are continuing after
OL,7,Fan oil spill caused by the vandalism of
OL,8,Fa nearby home heating oil tank resulted
OL,9,Fin the death of 13 birds from
OL,10,FBroughshane Waterfowl Park.
OL,12,FMore than 20 birds were transported to
OL,13,Fthe USPCA's headquarters last week for
OL,14,Furgent specialist care, but the death
OL,15,Ftoll has continued to rise.
OL,17,FThe popular attraction in County Antrim
OL,18,Fhas been forced to close while efforts
OL,19,Fcontinue to remove oil from the pond.
OL,21,FPolice have appealed for anyone with
OL,22,Finformation to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
